      "review_description": "Game is GREAT and I know it’s early access but PLEASEEEE add a lock button so if you accidentally click grip it won’t reset you. And please make different modes that you can vote for, for example: Normal mode (you can see every other hider but it’s not infection). Also please make it so host can change time for hiding and seeking because gallery does not have a lot of time. Also people are really racist so please add reporting. And last thing, at the end of the round it shows where everyone was hiding but please add a thing (like maybe a green outline) so you can see where the people who survived were",
